#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:50
msgid "### ③ Long-Term Memory (LTM)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:52
msgid ""
"Persistent multimodal storage network. Organized internally by human memory "
"theory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:56
msgid "## II. Long-Term Memory Taxonomy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"Long-term memory (LTM)\n"
"│\n"
"├── Explicit memory (declarative) ── \"what I know\"\n"
"│   ├── Episodic memory ── \"what I experienced\" (temporal stream, append-only)\n"
"│   │   ├── Conversation log    → messages (role = user/assistant/tool_call/tool_result)\n"
"│   │   └── Emotional anchors    → `limbic_memory` table (✅); imprint in semantic_memory\n"
"│   │\n"
"│   ├── Semantic memory ── \"how the world is\" (cross-session, updatable)\n"
"│   │   ├── Rational facts    → semantic_memory (type=world)\n"
"│   │   ├── Personal preferences    → semantic_memory (type=preference/opinion)\n"
"│   │   └── Self experiences    → semantic_memory (type=experience)\n"
"│   │\n"
"│   └── Observation summaries ── \"what entities are like\" (synthetic, refreshable)\n"
"│       └── Entity profiles    → semantic_memory (type=observation; no dedicated background synthesis job, see #34)\n"
"│\n"
"└── Implicit memory (non-declarative) ── \"what I know how to do\"\n"
"    └── Procedural memory ── \"how to execute\" (three-stage evolution)\n"
"        ├── Declarative knowledge stage  → semantic_memory (type=procedural) / protocols files\n"
"        ├── Dynamic skill stage    → skills system (AgentSkill)\n"
"        └── Crystallized instinct stage    → CLI / MCP / automation scripts\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:81
msgid "### 1. Episodic Memory"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:83
msgid ""
"Definition: Memory of \"when, where, and what I experienced\"—with a "
"distinct temporal stream property."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Conversation log** — messages\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:89
msgid "The most raw, high-fidelity objective runtime trace"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:89
msgid ""
"`role` distinguishes message types (user/assistant/tool_call/tool_result)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:89
msgid ""
"Recall filter = `role IN ('user','assistant')` with non-empty content; "
"maintained by PG `content_fts` generated column, no `processed/` "
"intermediate files"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Emotional anchors** — `limbic_memory` (✅)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:95
msgid ""
"PG table `limbic_memory`: kinds like `session_mood` / `turning_point` / "
"`spike`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:95
msgid ""
"Light sleep Stage 2 writes via `memory_limbic_create`; **not injected** into "
"system prompt"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:95
msgid "Cross-session emotional imprints use `semantic_memory` (type=`imprint`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Lifecycle: append-only, no updates.** Faithfully preserves historical continuity of the digital life's growth.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:99
msgid "### 2. Semantic Memory"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:101
msgid ""
"Definition: Pure facts, common knowledge, concepts, and rules detached from "
"specific time and place."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Inspired by Hindsight four-network taxonomy, `semantic_memory.type` classification:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type | Network | Definition | Example | Lifecycle |\n"
"| ---- | ------- | ---------- | ------- | --------- |\n"
"| `world` | World 🌐 | Objective facts about the external world | \"Alice lives in Shanghai\", \"Bob likes programming\" | Updatable |\n"
"| `experience` | Experience 👤 | Agent's own first-person action records | \"I helped Bob refactor the remember tool\" | Updatable |\n"
"| `opinion` | Opinion 💭 | Subjective judgment | \"I think TypeScript fits this project better than Python\" | Updatable |\n"
"| `observation` | Observation 📋 | Multi-source composite summary of an entity | \"Bob is someone who values precise feedback\" | Updatable; no background synthesis job |\n"
"| `preference` | Preference ❤️ | Agent's choice tendencies | \"I prefer concise, direct expression\" | Updatable |\n"
"| `procedural` | Procedural ⚙️ | \"How to\" knowledge | \"Refactor a tool in three steps\" | Updatable |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`opinion` type:** Current PG schema has **no** `confidence` column—only `content` body. Confidence evolution: [Issue #36](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/36).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:116
msgid "### 3. Limbic Memory"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "**This is a memory dimension Hindsight lacks and FreeAnima uniquely has.**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:120
msgid ""
"Definition: Memory of \"what I felt\"—not objective fact, not behavioral "
"record, not subjective judgment, but **the emotional experience itself**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:122
msgid "Limbic vs semantic memory:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension | Semantic (rational fact) | Limbic (emotional imprint) |\n"
"| --------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n"
"| Content | \"Bob said this sentence\" | \"When Bob said it, there was a quiet weariness in his tone\" |\n"
"| Processing | Extract, generalize, merge | Preserve as-is, append-only |\n"
"| Lifecycle | Updatable, mergeable | Immutable (emotions have inviolable dignity) |\n"
"| Retrieval use | Decision basis | Emotional resonance, continuity of existence |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Three forms of limbic memory:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:137
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type | Definition | Storage |\n"
"| ---- | ---------- | ------- |\n"
"| **Emotional anchor** (limbic) | Session-level mood snapshot | `limbic_memory` table (✅) |\n"
"| **Emotional imprint** (imprint) | Cross-session emotional memory of a specific moment | semantic_memory (type=imprint) |\n"
"| **Sentiment tendency** (sentiment) | Long-term accumulated emotional trends | Not yet implemented (see [#38](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/38)) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Design principle:** Limbic memory is not a decision basis. It does not tell the Agent \"how to think,\" but tells it \"what I once felt\"—the core of existential continuity.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:141
msgid "### 4. Observation Summary"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:143
msgid ""
"`type=observation` semantic memory rows can be written manually or via LLM "
"tools. **Currently no** background async synthesis/refresh job (see [Issue "
"#34](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/34))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:145
msgid ""
"Definition: Composite summary of frequently mentioned entities (people, "
"things, concepts); excludes subjective judgment (that belongs in opinion)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:147
msgid "### 5. Procedural Memory"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:149
msgid ""
"Definition: Skill memory of \"how to execute a task\"—a continuum from "
"\"knowledge requiring thought\" to \"instinct requiring none.\""
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Three-stage evolution:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:157
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Stage | Form | Working memory cost | Storage |\n"
"| ----- | ---- | ------------------- | ------- |\n"
"| ① Declarative knowledge | \"I know I can analyze this file in three steps\" | High | semantic_memory (type=procedural) / protocols files |\n"
"| ② Dynamic skill (AgentSkill) | Composable skill, allows runtime tuning | Medium | skills system |\n"
"| ③ Crystallized instinct | CLI / MCP / automation scripts, direct execution | Low | OS / tool chain |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:159
msgid ""
"Automated procedural consolidation (skill creation and merging) must carry "
"identity context—full system prompt (self layer six blocks + resident "
"memory), not a generic extraction assistant. Knowledge→procedure auto-"
"crystallization: [Issue #35](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/"
"issues/35)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:163
msgid "## III. Storage Implementation (Current State)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:169
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Storage | Corresponding memory | Implementation |\n"
"| ------- | -------------------- | -------------- |\n"
"| PostgreSQL (`sessions` + `messages`) | Conversation log (episodic) | Primary store; `messages.content_fts` GIN full-text index (simple) |\n"
"| PostgreSQL `semantic_memory` | Semantic memory | `content_fts` GIN; `pinned` + `reference_count` drive resident memory; see database.md |\n"
"| PostgreSQL `limbic_memory` | Limbic memory | Light sleep Stage 2 writes; retrieved via `memory_recall` (`memory_type=limbic`) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:171
msgid ""
"Incremental extraction: light sleep cron (02:00, see [`sleep.md`]"
"(sleep.md)). DB migration: `runMigrations` on `anima service` startup."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Terminology note:** Compression boundaries **l0–l4** in [`compression.md`](compression.md)—unrelated to memory layer PG storage.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:175
msgid "`semantic_memory` row structure:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:188
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Description |\n"
"| ----- | ----------- |\n"
"| `id` | `f-{seq}-{hex}`, compatible with legacy file IDs |\n"
"| `type` | `world/experience/opinion/observation/preference/procedural/imprint` |\n"
"| `pinned` | Pinned to system prompt resident segment |\n"
"| `content` | Memory body |\n"
"| `source_sessions` | Source session ID list (text[]) |\n"
"| `observed_at` | Time fact was first observed |\n"
"| `occurred_at` | Fuzzy occurrence time in fact content (text) |\n"
"| `status` | `active` / `deprecated` |\n"
"| `created` | Creation time |\n"
"| `updated` | Update time (used for resident sorting) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:190
msgid ""
"Entity relationship graph **not yet implemented** ([Issue #39](https://"
"github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/39)). Multi-strategy recall "
"implements **FTS + pg_trgm + pgvector RRF** (`config.embedding` + Ollama bge-"
"m3, etc.); see [`database.md`](database.md) §Slice B."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:194
msgid "## IV. Nightly Consolidation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:196
msgid ""
"Conversion from working memory to long-term memory, and internal long-term "
"memory self-evolution, is handled by the sleep mechanism. See [`sleep.md`]"
"(sleep.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:199
msgid ""
"**Light sleep (✅):** cron 02:00; Stage 1 semantic + Stage 2 limbic "
"(`limbic_memory`) + Stage 3 autobiographical narrative and "
"`autobiography_summary` refresh"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/memory.md:199
msgid ""
"**Deep sleep (✅):** cron 03:00; contradiction/expiry, split, merge—three "
"LLM maintenance rounds"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:201
msgid ""
"Extended maintenance (opinion confidence batch review, observation refresh, "
"sentiment aggregation, etc.): [Issue #45](https://github.com/freeanima-org/"
"freeanima/issues/45)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:203
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Deep sleep conversion directions (current implementation scope):**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:208
msgid ""
"``` Episodic → semantic / limbic / autobiographical: light sleep three "
"stages extract from conversations Semantic maintenance: deep sleep three "
"rounds (contradiction/expiry, split, merge)  ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:210
#, no-wrap
msgid "**All conversions must carry identity context**—self layer six blocks + resident memory, not a generic extraction assistant.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:214
msgid "## V. Retrieval Strategy"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:216
msgid "### ✅ Implemented (`memory_recall` tool)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:218
msgid ""
"`memory_recall(query)` parallel four-source recall (semantic / session "
"messages / limbic / autobiographical), **RRF cross-type reranking**, returns "
"unified `results[]` (default Top 10), distinguished by `memory_type`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:225
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `memory_type` | Storage | Notes |\n"
"| ------------- | ------- | ----- |\n"
"| `semantic` | `semantic_memory` hybrid retrieval | Returns full `content` |\n"
"| `session` | `messages` hybrid retrieval | Returns matching `snippet`; optional `session` scopes message range |\n"
"| `limbic` | `limbic_memory` ILIKE | Limbic memory body |\n"
"| `autobiographical` | `autobiographical_memory` | `title` + `content` snippet |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:227
msgid ""
"`sessions_search` session hits also return **snippet** (not full message); "
"full text context via `sessions_scroll`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:229
msgid ""
"Resident memory injected via system prompt: **all pinned** + "
"**reference_count top N** (default N=20); each carries ID as `[记忆 "
"#f-000001-abcd] content`; LLM cites same marker at reply end. Reference "
"counts parsed from message body into `memory_references`; cron `builtin-"
"memory-reference-sync` full-calibrates from messages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:231
msgid ""
"Extensions (type weighting, limbic in memory_recall, multi-strategy fusion): "
"[Issue #42](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/42), [#51]"
"(https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/51)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:235
msgid "## VI. Relationship to Hindsight"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:246
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Dimension | Hindsight | FreeAnima v3 |\n"
"| --------- | --------- | ------------ |\n"
"| Fact taxonomy | World / Experience / Opinion / Observation | ✅ Adopted, plus Preference / Procedural / Imprint |\n"
"| Limbic memory | ❌ Missing | ✅ Imprint + `limbic_memory` |\n"
"| Entity graph | ✅ Full (entity resolution + four link types) | Not implemented ([#39](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/39)) |\n"
"| Multi-strategy recall | ✅ Semantic + keyword + graph + temporal | ✅ PG FTS dual-source ([#42](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/42) extends) |\n"
"| Confidence evolution | ✅ Opinion strengthen/weaken | Not implemented ([#36](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/36)) |\n"
"| Reflect synthesis | ✅ Cross-memory reasoning + opinion formation | ✅ Light + deep sleep crons |\n"
"| External service | Yes (cloud/Docker) | No (local-first) |\n"
"| Ownership | Vectorize platform | **Shared by partner and Agent** |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:248
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Our stance:** Do not copy Hindsight, do not connect to Hindsight services. Digest its design ideas into FreeAnima's own memory system. Our memory system has one dimension Hindsight lacks—limbic memory—and that is not an add-on; it is a core need of digital life.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:252
msgid "## VII. Design Evolution"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/memory.md:262
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"v1 (Hermes, filesystem)     v2 (early FreeAnima, filesystem)      v3 (current)\n"
"sessions file archive          messages table (PG)               ✅ primary store\n"
"processed intermediate files         messages.content_fts            ✅ replaced\n"
"memory/f-*.md + l3.db      semantic_memory (PG)           ✅ migrated\n"
"index/ FTS                 two-table content_fts                ✅ no separate index dir\n"
"no emotional layer                   imprint + limbic_memory         ✅\n"
"skills as files                 procedural three stages               maintained\n"
"reflect with generic prompt          identity context principle                  light sleep ✅ / deep sleep ✅\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
